From c94a60dfc8d2e1186a248c802ad6313f1715eeb7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Rahul Ganesh <rahulbabu95@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 02:18:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Propagate observed Hardware addresses

Allow addressless Hardware to proceed through provisioning and copy observed Hardware status addresses into TinkerbellMachine status. Watch Hardware changes in local and external Tinkerbell modes so SLAAC addresses reconcile after the installed OS requests metadata.
---
